        "text": "Justice Souter asked: \u201cUnder your theory, any objector can appeal, I take it?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "99c3eb53aa2fe3d8c16db93406098dd2d0fb32b3028c9a0321ec470e2dd73bca",
