              "start": 21
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kennedy asked: \u201cWill your rule hold for certiorari petitions as well, so if, let's say, a named class member takes an appeal, but then the class petitions for certiorari, that any non\u2011named class member can petition for certiorari?\u201d"
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice",
        "citations": [
