              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 26,
                "start": 26
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "The respondents contend that only parties to a lawsuit, or those who properly become parties, may appeal an adverse judgment."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "Respondents",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "99c3eb53aa2fe3d8c16db93406098dd2d0fb32b3028c9a0321ec470e2dd73bca",
